Dialogue: 99,0:00:01.48,0:00:02.98,Dialogue,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Uau, privește.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:03.35,0:00:05.51,Dialogue,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Camerele sunt așa de variate.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:05.51,0:00:07.76,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,Nu te entuziasma prea tare.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:07.76,0:00:08.36,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,Ei bine,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:09.00,0:00:12.04,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,nu aș spune că e profesional închirierea unei camere la un hotel pentru cupluri.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:13.88,0:00:17.50,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mă simțeam prost s-o las acasă \Nîn timp ce eu eram plecată cu munca.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:15.77,0:00:17.50,Dialogue,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,{\an8}Camera asta e superbă.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:17.87,0:00:20.82,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Un hotel ieftin și \Nobișnuit ar fi fost de ajuns,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:20.82,0:00:24.17,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}dar acesta mă face să \Nmă simt puțin jenată.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:24.17,0:00:25.38,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of, fie!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:30.95,0:00:32.84,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,Asta e perfect.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:32.84,0:00:36.02,Dialogue,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Îmi place să te văd fericită, Akane.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:36.76,0:00:40.83,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Chiar nu are nicio legătură \Ncă suntem într-un loc
Dialogue: 99,0:00:40.83,0:00:43.40,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}unde mă poate convinge să facem sex.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:43.85,0:00:44.65,Dialogue,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Hei, Akane?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:45.36,0:00:46.40,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Și începe.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:46.91,0:00:50.03,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,Hei, am o întâlnire foarte \Nlungă în această seară,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:50.03,0:00:53.31,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,așa că trebuie să mă pregătesc, bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:54.83,0:00:56.12,Dialogue,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:56.12,0:00:59.87,Dialogue,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Voi trece în modul așteptare \Nca să nu te încurc.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:01.21,0:01:03.79,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Uau, chiar a înțeles.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:05.15,0:01:07.88,Dialogue,Coworker,0,0,0,,Perfect. Ne vedem mâine atunci.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:07.88,0:01:10.45,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,Abia aștept. Ne vedem mâine.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:12.98,0:01:15.56,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stai, ea chiar nu \Na încercat să facă nimic?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:16.12,0:01:19.15,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eram sigură că va încerca să-mi facă ceva indecent,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:19.15,0:01:20.89,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}dar nu, nimic.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:22.01,0:01:22.65,Dialogue,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Akane?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:22.65,0:01:23.52,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,Da?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:23.78,0:01:25.55,Dialogue,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,S-a încheiat întâlnirea?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:25.55,0:01:26.58,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:26.58,0:01:27.65,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gata.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:27.93,0:01:29.54,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}O să înceapă.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:29.54,0:01:31.78,Dialogue,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Atunci, ne băgăm la somn?
