Dialogue: 99,0:01:35.33,0:01:37.79,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cum naiba ar trebui să adorm?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:38.03,0:01:40.27,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Chiar nu are de gând să-mi facă nimic?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:40.27,0:01:42.70,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Trebuie să mă trezesc devreme mâine, \Ndeci ar trebui să dorm, dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:42.70,0:01:44.67,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Liniștește-te.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:45.20,0:01:46.29,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Liniștește-te odată.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:48.51,0:01:50.30,Dialogue,TV,0,0,0,,{\an8}Te vreau acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:49.38,0:01:50.30,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,Ce? E de la TV?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:50.60,0:01:52.21,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,Ce ciudat.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:53.20,0:01:55.05,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,De ce nu vrea să se oprească prostia asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:55.88,0:01:58.81,Dialogue,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Acea fată îmi amintește de tine, Akane.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:59.96,0:02:00.81,Dialogue,Akane,0,0,0,,Ce? Cum așa?
