Dialogue: 99,0:02:06.17,0:02:08.51,Dialogue,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Hei, Akane?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:10.25,0:02:13.11,Dialogue,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Ai vrea să facem și noi ce fac ele?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:14.57,0:02:16.45,Dialogue,TV,0,0,0,,Da, te vreau.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:16.77,0:02:18.03,Dialogue,TV,0,0,0,,Ce mai exact vrei?
